pallil family — this was only a house-based identification.3 CONT3 CONT3 CONT 🏛️ Historical Note – Aranmula Period3 CONT3 CONT There was a close relationship between the family and the temple community. It is said that temple priests would bring “Naivedyam (Ney Choru)” to the shop. And, they would all eat together.3 CONT3 CONT Significance:3 CONT Indicates a time when there were no strong caste barriers between the Brahmin priests (Potties) and our forefathers3 CONT3 CONT 🧑‍💼 Business3 CONT3 CONT The family once had a successful trading business in Aranmula (Kizhakke Nada area).3 CONT3 CONT Continued business along with his elder Brother-in-law Parel Philipochan (Not to be confused with another Parel Philip from Palachuvadu, Mandiram — that was his son)3 CONT3 CONT3 CONT 📉 Business Decline & Migration3 CONT3 CONT The family business eventually failed from heavy debts due to betrayal by Philipochan.3 CONT The family relocated from Aranmula to Ranny (Vaikom area).3 CONT They moved along with a branch of the Parel family.3 CONT3 CONT3 CONT Great Grandmother:3 CONT Very limited information is currently available3 CONT Further research is required3 CONT3 CONT 🎥 Family Records3 CONT3 CONT A conversation with Chittar Appachan (approx. 26 years ago) was recorded.3 CONT This is now being digitized , The recording may provide additional historical insights.3 CONT3 CONT ✝️ Spiritual Heritage3 CONT3 CONT Conversion to Faith3 CONT Our grandfather Kochukunju Mathai became a born-again believer.3 CONT3 CONT Influences:3 CONT3 CONT An evangelist known as “Tamil David”3 CONT A missionary from England (“Saip”)3 CONT3 CONT These missionaries preached across: 3 CONT Travancore region3 CONT Including Aranmula3 CONT3 CONT3 CONT Contemporary Believers:3 CONT3 CONT K. V. Simon (Idayaranmula) also received the Gospel during this time and was actively involved in ministry3 CONT (Reference may be found in the book “Verpadu Sabhakalude Charithram”)3 CONT3 CONT ⛪ Before Conversion3 CONT3 CONT The Chennankara family originally belonged to the Marthoma Church3 CONT3 CONT 🙏 Faith Legacy3 CONT3 CONT By God’s grace, our forefathers came to salvation through: Grace alone, Faith alone3 CONT3 CONT This established a spiritual legacy that continues through generations.3 CONT3 CONT Today:3 CONT For at least six generations, our family has known and followed Jesus Christ as Lord and Savior.0 @13501568@ OBJE1 FILE 13501568.jpg2 FORM JPG1 DATE 3/13/20251 CHAN2 DATE 01 APR 20263 TIME 16:40:381 _CRE2 DATE 01 APR 20263 TIME 16:40:071 _SIF 01 _SMC 10 @19419382@ OBJE1 FILE 19419382.jpg2 FORM JPG1 CHAN2 DATE 01 APR 20263 TIME 11:18:371 _CRE2 DATE 30 MAR 20263 TIME 21:13:441 _SIF 01 _SMC 10 @13621022@ OBJE1 FILE 13621022.jpg2 FORM JPG1 DATE 8/18/20241 CHAN2 DATE 01 APR 20263 TIME 11:17:391 _CRE2 DATE 01 APR 20263 TIME 11:16:591 _SIF 01 _SMC 10 @96091920@ OBJE1 FILE 96091920.jpg2 FORM JPG1 CHAN2 DATE 02 APR 20263 TIME 02:00:571 _CRE2 DATE 01 APR 20263 TIME 23:51:261 _SIF 01 _SMC 10 @51941348@ OBJE1 FILE 51941348.jpg2 FORM JPG1 _CRE2 DATE 31 MAR 20263 TIME 19:09:511 _SIF 01 _SMC 10 @58991738@ OBJE1 FILE 58991738.jpg2 FORM JPG1 DATE 3/6/20231 _CRE2 DATE 24 SEP 20253 TIME 05:44:491 _SIF 01 _SMC 10 @95736604@ OBJE1 FILE 95736604.jpg2 FORM JPG1 DATE 4/3/20261 CHAN2 DATE 03 APR 20263 TIME 03:04:241 _CRE2 DATE 03 APR 20263 TIME 03:04:011 _SIF 01 _SMC 10 @44143199@ OBJE1 FILE 44143199.jpg2 FORM JPG1 CHAN2 DATE 02 APR 20263 TIME 18:59:571 _CRE2 DATE 24 SEP 20253 TIME 06:01:381 _SIF 01 _SMC 00 @94974915@ OBJE1 FILE 94974915.jpg2 FORM JPG1 DATE 6/9/20191 CHAN2 DATE 02 APR 20263 TIME 18:59:491 _CRE2 DATE 02 APR 20263 TIME 18:59:191 _SIF 01 _SMC 10 @62399884@ OBJE1 FILE 62399884.jpg2 FORM JPG1 DATE 7/25/20161 _CRE2 DATE 31 MAR 20263 TIME 19:15:121 _SIF 01 _SMC 10 @68939506@ OBJE1 FILE 68939506.jpg2 FORM JPG1 DATE 3/2